# SUPERVISOR_* is meant for root-level SUPERVISOR_*.md scratch reports, but
# core.ignorecase is true on Windows so it also swallows static/js/supervisor_*.js
# source files. supervisor_performance.js needed the first exception; the roster
# script is the second. Any future static/js/supervisor_*.js needs one too.
!static/js/supervisor_performance.js
!static/js/supervisor_roster.js
!docs/SUPERVISOR_HANDBOOK_AR.md
