# Throwaway diagnostic scripts and route/template dumps. Keepers belong in
# scripts/manual-diagnostics/, reports in docs/reports/.
scratch/

# Generated diagnostic dumps at the repo root. These are stdout snapshots from
# scripts/manual-diagnostics/audit_routes.py and audit_base_includes.py, so they
# go stale on every route or template change and show up as noise in unrelated
# diffs. Regenerate on demand instead. Paths are anchored to the root so the
# deliberately archived copies under docs/reports/ stay tracked.
/route_dump_full.txt
/route_admin_namespace.txt
/base_includes_audit.txt
/admin_routes.txt
/all_routes.txt
db_cols.txt
_worktrees/
_archived_dead_code/
